Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:29.46,Title,0,0,0,0,,《金属头》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:14.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（启动密码错误）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（启动密码错误）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我剥一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open one of those for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你受得了这些糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you're the only one who can stand these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩这玩意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the only things left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.16,0:01:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些猪全没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pigs have all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前那里全是猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be full of pigs, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 还有猪粪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that and pig shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗把它们都消灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dogs took care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.29,0:01:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我受不了做猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think I could hack being a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you could either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,做猪有什么不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so bad about being a pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's undignified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undignified?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻子和屁眼在一个高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking about with your nose the same height as your asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吻 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Snout. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪鼻子叫吻 不叫鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pigs have snouts, not noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以应该是你的吻和屁眼一个高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it would be your snout the same height as your asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻 吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nose, snout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天还是得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still trotting about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着别人的屁眼跑来跑去\N{\fnArial\fs30}gazing up everybody else's assholes all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.66,0:01:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of society is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,平等的社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}An equal one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you reckon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以试试 你们不会去太久吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give it a go. You're not gonna be long?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.21,0:02:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,最多五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes, max.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is mental, this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他也要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's dying anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正这样也救不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like it's gonna save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只剩几天了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got, what, days?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这里面的东西能让他最后几天舒坦些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it's what's in there makes those days easier…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就满足了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向我妹妹保证过我们会帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised my sister we'd help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:02:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都向她保证了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all promised her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.65,0:03:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说里面还会有其他东西 电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus there'll be other stuff in there. Batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各种东西 - 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All sorts. - OK. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙别拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the keys in the ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用得着你说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ahead of you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你听到什么动静 不要久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hear anything, yeah, don't fuck about, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tear straight off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五分钟 - 一分不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five minutes? - No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定会在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure it's gonna be in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然不确定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
