Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarke! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.19,0:08:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 不 不 不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no! Fuck, no! No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
