Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.03,0:10:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚 滚开 滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. Fuck you, you… Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,收得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你听得到 我是贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can hear me, it's Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,接啊 拜托 接啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up. Please, fucking pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不到你说话 你声音不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear you. You're not clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你听得到我说话 吹口哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you can hear me, just whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.49,0:15:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't talk for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在仓库发现一只狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a dog at the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.89,0:15:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道那只狗在那里多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know how long it had been in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它干掉了托尼和克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got Tony and Clarke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're gone. I'm… I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能再转告艾丽我很抱歉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And can you tell Ali that I'm sorry too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我们根本不该去 她说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said that we were mad to bother and she was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…只是想帮她安抚杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… We just wanted to help her with Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:15:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他拿点有帮助的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him something that might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我暂时甩掉那只狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost the dog for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我猜它还在运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my guess is it's still operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它应该能锁定这个信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm figuring it can lock onto this signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要中止通讯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm gonna have to go dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我腿上中了它的追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um… It stuck me with a tracker,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想办法取出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I managed to get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找个能过夜的地方躲起来 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to find somewhere overnight to hide out, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,找点药之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some medical stuff or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't make it back…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我给格雷姆带个话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you pass a message to Graham?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就告诉他我爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我转达吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please would you pass that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得关闭对讲机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to switch off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会努力回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try and make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.15,0:17:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 该死 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你前爪废了 你爬不上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your arm's fucked, so you can't climb the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看看吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, take a good look, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要等上很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be waiting a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very long time.
